msgid ""
"Filters with the same group key will be ORed together within the group, "
"while different filter groups will be ANDed together. Undefined group keys "
"are treated as unique groups, i.e. are not grouped together. For example, if"
" a table has three filters, of which two are for departments Finance and "
"Marketing (group key = 'department'), and one refers to the region Europe "
"(group key = 'region'), the filter clause would apply the filter (department"
" = 'Finance' OR department = 'Marketing') AND (region = 'Europe')."
msgstr ""
"Filtri s istim ključem grupe bit će spojeni operandom \"ILI\" unutar grupe, "
"dok će različite grupe filtara biti spojene operandom \"I\". Ne definirani "
"ključevi grupe tretiraju se kao jedinstvene grupe, tj. nisu grupirani "
"zajedno. Na primjer, ako tablica ima tri filtra, od kojih su dva za odjele "
"Financije i Marketing (ključ grupe = 'department'), a jedan se odnosi na "
"regiju Europa (ključ grupe = 'region'), klauzula FILTER primijenila bi "
"filtar (department = 'Finance' ILI department = 'Marketing') I (region = "
"'Europe')."

