#, python-format
msgid "The API response from %s does not match the IDatabaseTable interface."
msgstr "API odgovor od %s ne odgovara sučelju IDatabaseTable."

msgid ""
"The CSS for individual dashboards can be altered here, or in the dashboard "
"view where changes are immediately visible"
msgstr ""
"CSS za pojedinačne nadzorne ploče može se mijenjati ovdje ili u prikazu "
"nadzornih ploča, gdje su promjene odmah vidljive."

msgid ""
"The CTAS (create table as select) doesn't have a SELECT statement at the "
"end. Please make sure your query has a SELECT as its last statement. Then, "
"try running your query again."
msgstr ""
"CTAS (create table as select) nema SELECT naredbu na kraju. Molimo "
"provjerite da vaš upit ima SELECT kao posljednju naredbu. Zatim pokušajte "
"ponovno pokrenuti upit."

msgid ""
"The GeoJsonLayer takes in GeoJSON formatted data and renders it as "
"interactive polygons, lines and points (circles, icons and/or texts)."
msgstr ""
"GeoJSON sloj prima podatke formatirane u GeoJSON-u i prikazuje ih kao "
"interaktivne poligone, linije i točke (krugove, ikone i/ili tekstove)."

msgid ""
"The Sankey chart visually tracks the movement and transformation of values across\n"
"          system stages. Nodes represent stages, connected by links depicting value flow. Node\n"
"          height corresponds to the visualized metric, providing a clear representation of\n"
"          value distribution and transformation."
msgstr ""
"Sankey dijagram vizualno prati kretanje i transformaciju vrijednosti kroz "
"faze sustava. Čvorovi predstavljaju faze, povezane vezama koje prikazuju "
"protok vrijednosti. Visina čvora odgovara vizualiziranoj metrici, pružajući "
"jasan prikaz raspodjele i transformacije vrijednosti."

msgid "The URL is missing the dataset_id or slice_id parameters."
msgstr "URL nedostaju parametri dataset_id ili slice_id."

msgid "The X-axis is not on the filters list"
msgstr "X-os nije na popisu filtara."

msgid ""
"The X-axis is not on the filters list which will prevent it from being used in\n"
"            time range filters in dashboards. Would you like to add it to the filters list?"
msgstr ""
"Os X nije na popisu filtara, što sprječava njegovo korištenje u filtrima vremenskog raspona \n"
" na nadzornih ploča. Želite li ga dodati na popis filtara?"

msgid "The annotation has been saved"
msgstr "Anotacija je spremljena"

msgid "The annotation has been updated"
msgstr "Napomena je ažurirana."

msgid "The background color of the charts."
msgstr "Boja pozadine grafikona."

msgid ""
"The category of source nodes used to assign colors. If a node is associated "
"with more than one category, only the first will be used."
msgstr ""
"Kategorija izvorišnih čvorova koja se koristi za dodjelu boja. Ako je čvor "
"povezan s više kategorija, koristit će se samo prva."

msgid "The chart datasource does not exist"
msgstr "Izvor podataka grafikona ne postoji"

msgid "The chart does not exist"
msgstr "Grafikon ne postoji"

msgid "The chart query context does not exist"
msgstr "Kontekst upita za grafikon ne postoji"

msgid ""
"The classic. Great for showing how much of a company each investor gets, what demographics follow your blog, or what portion of the budget goes to the military industrial complex.\n"
"\n"
"        Pie charts can be difficult to interpret precisely. If clarity of relative proportion is important, consider using a bar or other chart type instead."
msgstr ""
"Klasik. Odlično za pokazivanje koliko udjela u tvrtki dobiva svaki ulagač, koja demografija prati vaš blog ili koji dio proračuna odlazi vojno-industrijskom kompleksu.\n"
"\n"
" Kružni dijagrami mogu biti teški za precizno tumačenje. Ako je važna jasnoća relativnih omjera, razmislite o upotrebi stupaca ili neke druge vrste dijagrama."

msgid "The color for points and clusters in RGB"
msgstr "Boja za točke i klastere u RGB-u"

msgid "The color of the elements border"
msgstr "Boja obruba elemenata"

msgid "The color of the isoband"
msgstr "Boja izobande"

msgid "The color of the isoline"
msgstr "Boja izolinije"

msgid "The color scheme for rendering chart"
msgstr "Shema boja za iscrtavanje grafikona"

msgid ""
"The color scheme is determined by the related dashboard.\n"
"        Edit the color scheme in the dashboard properties."
msgstr ""
"Shema boja određena je povezanim dashboardom.\n"
" Uredite shemu boja u svojstvima dashboarda."

msgid ""
"The colors of this chart might be overridden by custom label colors of the related dashboard.\n"
"    Check the JSON metadata in the Advanced settings."
msgstr ""
"Boje ovog grafikona mogu biti prebrisane prilagođenim bojama oznaka povezanog nadzornog ploče.\n"
" Provjerite JSON metapodatke u naprednim postavkama."

msgid "The column header label"
msgstr "Oznaka zaglavlja stupca"

msgid "The column to be used as the source of the edge."
msgstr "Stub koji će se koristiti kao izvor ruba."

msgid "The column to be used as the target of the edge."
msgstr "Stub koji će se koristiti kao cilj ruba."

msgid "The column was deleted or renamed in the database."
msgstr "Stupac je izbrisan ili preimenovan u bazi podataka."

msgid "The configuration for the map layers"
msgstr "Konfiguracija slojeva karte"

msgid "The corner radius of the chart background"
msgstr "Radijus kutnog zakrivljenja pozadine grafikona"

msgid ""
"The country code standard that Superset should expect to find in the "
"[country] column"
msgstr ""
"Standard koda zemlje koji bi Superset trebao očekivati u stupcu [country]"

msgid "The dashboard has been saved"
msgstr "Kontrolna ploča je spremljena"

msgid "The data source seems to have been deleted"
msgstr "Čini se da je izvor podataka izbrisan."

msgid "The database"
msgstr "Baza podataka"

msgid "The database columns that contains lines information"
msgstr "Stupci baze podataka koji sadrže informacije o redovima"

msgid "The database could not be found"
msgstr "Baza podataka nije pronađena"

msgid "The database is currently running too many queries."
msgstr "Baza podataka trenutno izvršava previše upita."

msgid "The database is under an unusual load."
msgstr "Baza podataka je pod neuobičajenim opterećenjem."

msgid ""
"The database referenced in this query was not found. Please contact an "
"administrator for further assistance or try again."
msgstr ""
"Baza podataka referencirana u ovom upitu nije pronađena. Molimo "
"kontaktirajte administratora za daljnju pomoć ili pokušajte ponovno."

msgid "The database returned an unexpected error."
msgstr "Baza podataka je vratila neočekivanu pogrešku."

msgid "The database that was used to generate this query could not be found"
msgstr ""
"Baza podataka koja je korištena za generiranje ovog upita nije pronađena."

msgid "The database was deleted."
msgstr "Baza podataka je izbrisana."

msgid "The database was not found."
msgstr "Baza podataka nije pronađena."

msgid "The dataset"
msgstr "Skup podataka"

msgid "The dataset associated with this chart no longer exists"
msgstr "Skup podataka povezan s ovim grafikonom više ne postoji."

msgid ""
"The dataset column/metric that returns the values on your chart's x-axis."
msgstr ""
"Kolona/metrika skupa podataka koja vraća vrijednosti na x-osam vašeg "
"grafikona."

msgid ""
"The dataset column/metric that returns the values on your chart's y-axis."
msgstr ""
"Stupac/metrika skupa podataka koji vraća vrijednosti na y-osi vašeg "
"grafikona."

msgid ""
"The dataset configuration exposed here\n"
"                affects all the charts using this dataset.\n"
"                Be mindful that changing settings\n"
"                here may affect other charts\n"
"                in undesirable ways."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguracija skupa podataka izložena ovdje\n"
" utječe na sve grafikone koji koriste ovaj skup podataka.\n"
" Imajte na umu da promjena postavki\n"
" ovdje može utjecati na druge grafikone\n"
" na neželjene načine."

msgid "The dataset has been saved"
msgstr "Podaci su spremljeni"

msgid "The dataset linked to this chart may have been deleted."
msgstr "Skup podataka povezan s ovim grafikonom možda je izbrisan."

msgid "The datasource couldn't be loaded"
msgstr "Izvor podataka nije mogao biti učitani"

msgid "The datasource is too large to query."
msgstr "Izvor podataka je prevelik za upit."

msgid "The default catalog that should be used for the connection."
msgstr "Zadani katalog koji se treba koristiti za vezu."

msgid "The default schema that should be used for the connection."
msgstr "Zadana shema koja se treba koristiti za vezu."

msgid ""
"The description can be displayed as widget headers in the dashboard view. "
"Supports markdown."
msgstr ""
"Opis se može prikazati kao zaglavlja widgeta u prikazu nadzorne ploče. "
"Podržava markdown."

msgid "The distance between cells, in pixels"
msgstr "Udaljenost između ćelija, u pikselsima"

msgid ""
"The duration of time in seconds before the cache is invalidated. Set to -1 "
"to bypass the cache."
msgstr ""
"Trajanje u sekundama prije nego što se predmemorija poništi. Postavite na -1"
" da zaobiđete predmemoriju."

msgid "The encoding format of the lines"
msgstr "Format kodiranja redaka"

msgid ""
"The engine_params object gets unpacked into the sqlalchemy.create_engine "
"call."
msgstr "Objekt engine_params raspakira se u poziv sqlalchemy.create_engine."

msgid "The exponent to compute all sizes from. \"EXP\" only"
msgstr "Eksponent za izračunavanje svih veličina. Samo \"EXP\""

msgid ""
"The extent of the map on application start. FIT DATA automatically sets the "
"extent so that all data points are included in the viewport. CUSTOM allows "
"users to define the extent manually."
msgstr ""
"Opseg karte pri pokretanju aplikacije. FIT DATA automatski postavlja opseg "
"tako da su sve točke podataka uključene u vidno polje. CUSTOM omogućuje "
"korisnicima ručno definiranje opsega."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The following entries in `series_columns` are missing in `columns`: "
"%(columns)s. "
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći unosi iz `series_columns` nedostaju u `columns`: %(columns)s. "

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The following filters have the 'Select first filter value by default'\n"
"                    option checked and could not be loaded, which is preventing the dashboard\n"
"                    from rendering: %s"
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći filtri imaju označenu opciju 'Select first filter value by default'\n"
" i nisu mogli biti učitani, što sprječava iscrtavanje nadzorne ploče\n"
": %s"

msgid "The function to use when aggregating points into groups"
msgstr "Funkcija koju koristiti pri grupiranju bodova u skupine"

msgid "The height of the current zoom level to compute all heights from"
msgstr "Visina trenutne razine zumiranja za izračunavanje svih visina"

msgid ""
"The histogram chart displays the distribution of a dataset by\n"
"          representing the frequency or count of values within different ranges or bins.\n"
"          It helps visualize patterns, clusters, and outliers in the data and provides\n"
"          insights into its shape, central tendency, and spread."
msgstr ""
"Grafikon histograma prikazuje raspodjelu skupa podataka \n"
", predstavljajući frekvenciju ili broj vrijednosti unutar različitih raspona ili kutija. \n"
" Pomaže vizualizirati obrasce, klastere i odstupanja u podacima te pruža \n"
" uvide u njegov oblik, središnju tendenciju i raspršenost."

#, python-format
msgid "The host \"%(hostname)s\" might be down and can't be reached."
msgstr "Domaćin \"%(hostname)s\" možda ne radi i nije dostupan."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The host \"%(hostname)s\" might be down, and can't be reached on port "
"%(port)s."
msgstr ""
"Domaćin \"%(hostname)s\" možda nije dostupan i nije moguće uspostaviti vezu "
"na portu %(port)s."

msgid "The host might be down, and can't be reached on the provided port."
msgstr ""
"Domaćin možda nije dostupan i nije moguće povezati se na navedeni port."

#, python-format
msgid "The hostname \"%(hostname)s\" cannot be resolved."
msgstr "Naziv domene \"%(hostname)s\" ne može se riješiti."

msgid "The hostname provided can't be resolved."
msgstr "Navedeno ime domene ne može se riješiti."

msgid "The id of the active chart"
msgstr "ID aktivnog grafikona"

msgid "The layer attribution"
msgstr "Pripisivanje sloja"

msgid "The lower limit of the threshold range of the Isoband"
msgstr "Donja granica raspona praga Isobanda"

msgid ""
"The maximum number of subdivisions of each group; lower values are pruned "
"first"
msgstr ""
"Maksimalan broj podjela svake skupine; niže vrijednosti se prvo uklanjaju"

msgid "The maximum value of metrics. It is an optional configuration"
msgstr "Maksimalna vrijednost metrika. To je neobavezna konfiguracija."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The metadata_params in Extra field is not configured correctly. The key "
"%(key)s is invalid."
msgstr ""
"Metadata_params u polju Extra nije ispravno konfiguriran. Ključ %(key)s je "
"nevažeći."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The metadata_params in Extra field is not configured correctly. The key "
"%{key}s is invalid."
msgstr ""
"Metadata_params u polju Extra nije ispravno konfiguriran. Ključ %{key}s je "
"nevažeći."

msgid ""
"The metadata_params object gets unpacked into the sqlalchemy.MetaData call."
msgstr "Objekt metadata_params raspakira se u poziv sqlalchemy.MetaData."

msgid ""
"The minimum number of rolling periods required to show a value. For instance"
" if you do a cumulative sum on 7 days you may want your \"Min Period\" to be"
" 7, so that all data points shown are the total of 7 periods. This will hide"
" the \"ramp up\" taking place over the first 7 periods"
msgstr ""
"Minimalni broj razdoblja obrade potreban da bi se prikazala vrijednost. Na "
"primjer, ako izračunavate kumulativnu sumu na 7 dana, možda ćete htjeti da "
"vaš \"Minimalni period\" bude 7, kako bi svi prikazani podaci bili zbroj "
"sedam razdoblja. To će sakriti \"rast\" koji se odvija tijekom prvih sedam "
"razdoblja."

msgid ""
"The minimum value of metrics. It is an optional configuration. If not set, "
"it will be the minimum value of the data"
msgstr ""
"Minimalna vrijednost metrika. To je neobavezna konfiguracija. Ako nije "
"postavljeno, bit će minimalna vrijednost podataka."

msgid "The name of the geometry column"
msgstr "Naziv stupca geometrije"

msgid "The name of the layer as described in GetCapabilities"
msgstr "Naziv sloja kako je opisan u GetCapabilities"

msgid "The name of the rule must be unique"
msgstr "Naziv pravila mora biti jedinstven."

msgid "The number color \"steps\""
msgstr "Broj boja \"koraka\""

msgid "The number of bins for the histogram"
msgstr "Broj kutija za histogram"

msgid ""
"The number of hours, negative or positive, to shift the time column. This "
"can be used to move UTC time to local time."
msgstr ""
"Broj sati, negativan ili pozitivan, za pomicanje stupca vremena. Ovo se može"
" koristiti za premještanje UTC vremena u lokalno vrijeme."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The number of results displayed is limited to %(rows)d by the configuration "
"DISPLAY_MAX_ROW. Please add additional limits/filters or download to csv to "
"see more rows up to the %(limit)d limit."
msgstr ""
"Broj prikazanih rezultata ograničen je na %(rows)d konfiguracijom "
"DISPLAY_MAX_ROW. Molimo dodajte dodatna ograničenja/filtre ili preuzmite u "
"CSV kako biste vidjeli više redaka do ograničenja %(limit)d."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The number of results displayed is limited to %(rows)d. Please add "
"additional limits/filters, download to csv, or contact an admin to see more "
"rows up to the %(limit)d limit."
msgstr ""
"Broj prikazanih rezultata ograničen je na %(rows)d. Molimo dodajte dodatna "
"ograničenja/filtre, preuzmite u CSV ili kontaktirajte administratora kako "
"biste vidjeli više redaka do ograničenja %(limit)d."

#, python-format
msgid "The number of rows displayed is limited to %(rows)d by the dropdown."
msgstr ""
"Broj prikazanih redaka ograničen je na %(rows)d pomoću padajućeg izbornika."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The number of rows displayed is limited to %(rows)d by the limit dropdown."
msgstr ""
"Broj prikazanih redaka ograničen je na %(rows)d pomoću padajućeg izbornika "
"ograničenja."

#, python-format
msgid "The number of rows displayed is limited to %(rows)d by the query"
msgstr "Broj prikazanih redaka ograničen je na %(rows)d upitom."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The number of rows displayed is limited to %(rows)d by the query and limit "
"dropdown."
msgstr ""
"Broj prikazanih redaka ograničen je na %(rows)d pomoću upita i padajućeg "
"izbornika za ograničenje."

msgid "The number of seconds before expiring the cache"
msgstr "Broj sekundi prije isteka keša"

msgid "The object does not exist in the given database."
msgstr "Predmet ne postoji u navedenoj bazi podataka."

#, python-format
msgid "The parameter %(parameters)s in your query is undefined."
msgid_plural ""
"The following parameters in your query are undefined: %(parameters)s."
msgstr[0] "Parametar %(parameters)s u vašem upitu nije definiran."
msgstr[1] "Sljedeći parametri u vašem upitu su neodređeni: %(parameters)s."
msgstr[2] "Sljedeći parametri u vašem upitu su neodređeni: %(parameters)s."

#, python-format
msgid "The password provided for username \"%(username)s\" is incorrect."
msgstr "Pravopis lozinke za korisničko ime \"%(username)s\" je netočan."

msgid "The password provided when connecting to a database is not valid."
msgstr "Pravopisne provjere nisu uspjele."

msgid ""
"The passwords for the databases below are needed in order to import them "
"together with the charts. Please note that the \"Secure Extra\" and "
"\"Certificate\" sections of the database configuration are not present in "
"export files, and should be added manually after the import if they are "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Loзинke za baze podataka navedene u nastavku potrebne su za njihovo uvoženje"
" zajedno s grafikama. Imajte na umu da sekcije \"Secure Extra\" i "
"\"Certificate\" u konfiguraciji baze podataka nisu prisutne u izvoznim "
"datotekama te ih je potrebno ručno dodati nakon uvoza ako su potrebne."

msgid ""
"The passwords for the databases below are needed in order to import them "
"together with the dashboards. Please note that the \"Secure Extra\" and "
"\"Certificate\" sections of the database configuration are not present in "
"export files, and should be added manually after the import if they are "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Loзинke za baze podataka navedene u nastavku potrebne su za njihovo uvoženje"
" zajedno s nadzornih ploča. Imajte na umu da sekcije \"Secure Extra\" i "
"\"Certificate\" u konfiguraciji baze podataka nisu prisutne u izvoznim "
"datotekama te ih je potrebno ručno dodati nakon uvoza ako su potrebne."

msgid ""
"The passwords for the databases below are needed in order to import them "
"together with the datasets. Please note that the \"Secure Extra\" and "
"\"Certificate\" sections of the database configuration are not present in "
"export files, and should be added manually after the import if they are "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Loзинke za baze podataka navedene u nastavku potrebne su za njihovo uvoženje"
" zajedno s skupovima podataka. Imajte na umu da sekcije \"Secure Extra\" i "
"\"Certificate\" u konfiguraciji baze podataka nisu prisutne u izvoznim "
"datotekama te ih je potrebno ručno dodati nakon uvoza ako su potrebne."

msgid ""
"The passwords for the databases below are needed in order to import them "
"together with the saved queries. Please note that the \"Secure Extra\" and "
"\"Certificate\" sections of the database configuration are not present in "
"export files, and should be added manually after the import if they are "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Loзинke za baze podataka navedene u nastavku potrebne su za njihovo uvoženje"
